  "description": "Rows inserted into policy_rules/policy_bindings for every new team (scope=team, scope_id=<teamId>), immutable post-seed in v1 (operator migrations only: a migration that adds rows here also inserts them for every existing seeded team). Evaluation: any matching deny denies (deny is absolute); priority orders competing allows; no match falls through to deny for define/merge/export/delete/restore/erase/admin and allow for view/create/edit/link. Agent bindings are namespaced agent:<app>:<agentId>, or agent:<app>:* for every agent of one app.",
